      "id": "pf_233299ed_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "As a proudly Canadian company, we’ve worked hard to keep our prices fair without compromising on quality or safety. However, rising costs across raw whey protein, ingredients, and production have made a modest subscription price adjustment necessary so we can continue delivering the products and service you expect."
