    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_379eb98a_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "Welcome to the Canadian Protein Subscription Program. These Subscription Terms &amp; Conditions explain how our subscription service works, including billing, pricing, order management, shipping, returns, and other important details.By purchasing a subscription product from Canadian Protein, you agree to these Subscription Terms &amp; Conditions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_4e5cfbba_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "You must have an activated Canadian Protein account to have full access to your subscription. Once the Canadian Protein account is activated you can visit My Account &gt; Manage Subscription."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_4ea61b85_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Subscriptions can not be accessed through a mobile device, all edits are to be made with a computer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_52001d7e_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Yes — your locked-in subscription discount will continue to apply to your orders. However, the base price of affected products has increased due to rising ingredient and production costs.&nbsp;For example, if your subscription includes a 5% locked-in discount, that discount will still be applied to your orders, but it will be calculated based on the new product pricing."
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_56e4f527_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "<strong>ⓘ&nbsp; November 2025 | Price Increase Notice:</strong><br><br>Effective November 2025, the prices of select Canadian Protein Protein Products will be adjusted to reflect increased ingredient and production costs. Prices will increase by $10 for 1kg sizes and $20 for 2kg sizes. While this adjustment is necessary to maintain our commitment to premium ingredients and high manufacturing standards, Canadian Protein continues to offer some of the most competitively priced, high-quality protein products in the market. Our goal remains to provide exceptional value without compromising on quality, purity, or taste.<br><br>Locked-in subscription discounts (from previous promotions) will continue to be honoured; however, the base price of affected products will reflect the updated pricing. Customers with existing subscription discounts will still receive their agreed-upon percentage off, applied to the new base prices.<br><br>November 2025 price increase products include, but are not limited to:<br>- Economy Whey - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Whey Protein Concentrate - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Premium Whey Protein Blend - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Whey Protein Isolate - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Grass-Fed New Zealand  Whey Protein Concentrate - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Grass-Fed New Zealand Whey Protein Isolate - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Premium Whey Protein Isolate - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Vegan Protein - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br><br>Updated: November 11th 2025.&nbsp;"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_577d240e_label",
      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "Why is my subscription order not applying a discount code?"
