      "label": "Accordion.Header — Label",
      "default": "Why can’t I alter my subscriptions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_70891858_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Our subscription service is designed to make your life easier, ensuring you never run out of your favorite Canadian Protein supplements. With our service, you can enjoy regular, hassle-free deliveries right to your doorstep. So, whether you're new to Canadian Protein or a loyal customer, read on to discover how our Subscription Program can benefit you and answer all your questions. Remember, we're committed to your fitness journey and here to help you every step of the way! "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_76a3379e_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "Subscription Terms &amp; Conditions"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_7f7e6fa1_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Some promotions and discount codes cannot be combined with subscription orders. To check whether a current sale applies to subscriptions, please scroll to the bottom of the main sale landing page and review the FAQs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_804e41ec_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Yes. You will keep the subscription discount you locked in, based on the terms of the promotion you joined.&nbsp;Some promotions offer discounts that never expire, while others are valid only for a set time period. Please note:&nbsp;Even when your discount remains active, product prices may increase over time, and your discount will apply to the updated product price."
