      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "<b>Program Specifics:</b>\n<br>The Canadian Protein Subscription Program is available on select products across our website.Subscription orders already include subscription pricing where applicable. Some sales, promotions, and discount codes cannot be combined with subscription orders. To find out whether an active promotion applies to subscriptions, please review the FAQs at the bottom of the applicable sale landing page.<br><br><b>Eligibility:</b><br>The subscription program is available to customers shopping on canadianprotein.com. Availability of products, payment methods, shipping options, and support services may vary by region.<br><br><b>Pricing and Payment:</b><br>Subscription pricing is set by Canadian Protein and may change from time to time.Accepted payment methods may include major credit cards, debit cards, PayPal, Google Pay, and Shop Pay, depending on availability at checkout. By placing a subscription order, you authorize Canadian Protein to charge your selected payment method on a recurring basis according to your chosen subscription frequency, unless your subscription is skipped, paused, or canceled in accordance with these terms.If there is an issue with billing or payment, please contact our customer support team for assistance.<br><br><b>Changes and Cancellations:</b>\n<br>Customers can manage or cancel their subscriptions by logging into their subscription account and following the provided instructions. While there are no fees for canceling, a minimum of three orders is required before a subscription can be canceled.<br><br><b>Shipping and Returns:</b><br>Our shipping policy for the subscription program follows our standard shipping policy.<br><br>&gt;&gt;<a href=\"https://canadianprotein.com/pages/terms-and-conditions\" target=\"_self\">Click here to view our shipping standard policy</a>&lt;&lt;<br><br>Returns of products received through the subscription program are subject to our standard return policy.<br><br>&gt;&gt;<a href=\"https://support.canadianprotein.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500001289922-What-is-Canadian-Protein-s-Return-Policy-\" target=\"_self\">Click here to view out standard returns policy</a>&lt;&lt;<br><br><b>Data Privacy:</b><br>We are committed to protecting customer data in accordance with our Privacy Policy. By participating in the subscription program, customers agree to the collection, use, and processing of their personal data as outlined in the Privacy Policy.<br>\n<br>&gt;&gt;<a href=\"https://canadianprotein.com/pages/privacy-policy-1\" target=\"_self\"></a><a href=\"https://canadianprotein.com/pages/privacy-policy-1\" target=\"_self\">Click here to view our full Privacy policy</a>&lt;&lt;<br><br><b>Security:</b><br>We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to help protect your personal information and payment data.While we take security seriously, no method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security. We employ security measures, including encryption and secure methods, to protect customer data. However, we cannot guarantee the absolute security of transmitted or stored information.\n<br><br><b>Disputes and Liability:</b><br>These Subscription Terms &amp; Conditions shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Province of Ontario and the federal laws of Canada applicable therein.To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Canadian Protein shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising out of or relating to the subscription program, including delays, product unavailability, pricing changes, or interruptions in service.Nothing in these Subscription Terms &amp; Conditions limits any rights that may apply under applicable consumer protection laws.\n<br><br><b>Changes to Terms:</b><br>Canadian Protein may update or modify these Subscription Terms &amp; Conditions from time to time.Any changes will take effect once posted to this page, unless otherwise stated. Your continued use of the subscription program after any updates are posted constitutes acceptance of those changes.\n\n"
